  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39836528",
      "title": "Handling Project Creation & Updating the UI",
      "sourceHash": "c012c0112399db90149fdb3df5b9ef73369e6821296545682a0099f6ec7b3af2",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.334,
          "end": 1.83,
          "en": "So let's now make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.83,
          "end": 3.72,
          "en": "we close this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 3.72,
          "end": 7.113,
          "en": "We remove it from the screen if we click save.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.64,
          "end": 10.02,
          "en": "Now, to achieve that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.02,
          "end": 13.71,
          "en": "we of course must make sure that in the app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.71,
          "end": 17.61,
          "en": "where I will now also remove this console log statement,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.61,
          "end": 20.28,
          "en": "we set the selected project ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.28,
          "end": 21.723,
          "en": "back to undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.882,
          "end": 27.09,
          "en": "Because at the moment, it's set to null and it stays null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.09,
          "end": 30.9,
          "en": "which is why this component here does not disappear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.9,
          "end": 33.256,
          "en": "because the new project component is shown",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.256,
          "end": 37.623,
          "en": "for as long as the selected project ID is equal to null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.111,
          "end": 41.73,
          "en": "So, if we want to get rid of that component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.73,
          "end": 42.873,
          "en": "we should change it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.74,
          "end": 45.723,
          "en": "And now here we got two options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.62,
          "end": 50.13,
          "en": "In handle add project where we update the state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.13,
          "end": 52.893,
          "en": "we can set the selected project ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.893,
          "end": 57.303,
          "en": "to undefined to go back to that fallback screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.68,
          "end": 60.75,
          "en": "If I do that and I save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.75,
          "end": 63.873,
          "en": "if I click save here, you see we go back to this screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.25,
          "end": 67.293,
          "en": "And that is a fine option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.31,
          "end": 71.4,
          "en": "As an alternative, we could also set it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.4,
          "end": 74.086,
          "en": "to the ID we generated here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.086,
          "end": 77.67,
          "en": "So we could generate this ID here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.67,
          "end": 80.91,
          "en": "Project ID could be stored in a constant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.91,
          "end": 83.463,
          "en": "and then use it here and also here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.614,
          "end": 88.44,
          "en": "And that would then automatically select that project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.44,
          "end": 90.36,
          "en": "But I'm not going to do that here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.36,
          "end": 92.94,
          "en": "because at the moment we can't really handle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.94,
          "end": 95.733,
          "en": "that case that we select a project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.87,
          "end": 100.38,
          "en": "So I'll set it to undefined so that we at least go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.38,
          "end": 102.93299999999999,
          "en": "to this screen here, to this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.987,
          "end": 106.28999999999999,
          "en": "But now I also wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.28999999999999,
          "end": 110.297,
          "en": "that my projects are being output here in the sidebar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.297,
          "end": 112.71000000000001,
          "en": "And for that, to achieve that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.71000000000001,
          "end": 115.44,
          "en": "we of course must pass our project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.44,
          "end": 117.963,
          "en": "to this project sidebar component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.19,
          "end": 122.403,
          "en": "There, we could add a projects prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.27,
          "end": 124.92,
          "en": "And as a value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.92,
          "end": 128.197,
          "en": "we wanna pass in projectsState.project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.01,
          "end": 133.2,
          "en": "because that's this array of projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 133.2,
          "end": 135.39,
          "en": "we're managing here in our state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.39,
          "end": 139.35,
          "en": "And we're now passing that through a prop named projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.35,
          "end": 141.423,
          "en": "to the project sidebar component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.5,
          "end": 144.51,
          "en": "So in that component, we can therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.51,
          "end": 147.01,
          "en": "now output those projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.01,
          "end": 150.063,
          "en": "And I wanna do that here in that unordered list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.45499999999998,
          "end": 153.03,
          "en": "So therefore, they are, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.03,
          "end": 157.8,
          "en": "we first of all must accept and extract this projects prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.8,
          "end": 160.233,
          "en": "in this projects sidebar component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.85,
          "end": 165.03,
          "en": "And then here in that unordered list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 165.03,
          "end": 170.03,
          "en": "I'll add a dynamic expression where I use this projects prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 170.79,
          "end": 174.06,
          "en": "to map through all the items in this array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 174.06,
          "end": 177.603,
          "en": "so that every item is output as a JSX element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 179.01,
          "end": 181.14,
          "en": "So here, we'll go through all the projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 181.14,
          "end": 184.173,
          "en": "And for every project I wanna return a list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 185.31,
          "end": 188.564,
          "en": "Now, as you learned, whenever you're using map like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 188.564,
          "end": 191.039,
          "en": "the root item to which you are mapping,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 191.039,
          "end": 195.25,
          "en": "so the list item in this case, should receive a key prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 196.38,
          "end": 200.7,
          "en": "which must be set to a unique identifier for this item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 200.7,
          "end": 203.16,
          "en": "And here the perfect identifier, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 203.16,
          "end": 205.226,
          "en": "is the ID of that project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 205.226,
          "end": 209.79,
          "en": "because that is unique for every project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 209.79,
          "end": 212.7,
          "en": "Now, between the LI text, I then wanna have a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 212.7,
          "end": 217.478,
          "en": "because the goal is to make these projects selectable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 217.478,
          "end": 219.45,
          "en": "so that we can click on them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 219.45,
          "end": 223.14,
          "en": "and view the details for the selected project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 223.14,
          "end": 224.55,
          "en": "Between those button tags,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 224.55,
          "end": 227.073,
          "en": "I'll therefore output the project title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 227.916,
          "end": 231.63,
          "en": "Now of course, we also need some styling here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 231.63,
          "end": 234.333,
          "en": "To be precise, I wanna style the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 235.35,
          "end": 236.79,
          "en": "And on this button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 236.79,
          "end": 239.46,
          "en": "I'll add the w-full clause",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 239.46,
          "end": 242.973,
          "en": "to make sure that this button uses all the width it can use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 244.14,
          "end": 247.653,
          "en": "I'll add text left to move the text to the left.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 248.76,
          "end": 250.92,
          "en": "I'll add some padding to the left and right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 250.92,
          "end": 253.113,
          "en": "and some padding to the top and bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 254.43,
          "end": 257.1,
          "en": "Give it slightly rounded corners",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 257.1,
          "end": 259.503,
          "en": "and add a margin to the top and bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 260.76,
          "end": 264.723,
          "en": "In addition, I'll add a text color text stone 400.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 265.56,
          "end": 269.58,
          "en": "Keep in mind that this button will be on a dark background,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 269.58,
          "end": 271.983,
          "en": "which is why I'm picking a light text color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 273.079,
          "end": 275.82,
          "en": "And I also need some hover styles here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 275.82,
          "end": 279.51,
          "en": "so that we change this text if we hover over it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 279.51,
          "end": 281.85,
          "en": "And I'll change to a very light text now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 281.85,
          "end": 285.21,
          "en": "because I'll give this an even darker background now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 285.21,
          "end": 286.83299999999997,
          "en": "if we hover over the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 289.17,
          "end": 294.09000000000003,
          "en": "With that, I got a bunch of styles here on this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 294.09000000000003,
          "end": 296.49,
          "en": "And therefore now if we save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 296.49,
          "end": 299.33299999999997,
          "en": "we should see the projects here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 299.33299999999997,
          "end": 300.69,
          "en": "And if I hover over them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 300.69,
          "end": 303.51,
          "en": "you see that they are getting highlighted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 303.51,
          "end": 305.999,
          "en": "And of course, we can also reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 305.999,
          "end": 310.999,
          "en": "and add a new project here and it shows up here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 312.316,
          "end": 315,
          "en": "Now, it would be nice to have more spacing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 315,
          "end": 318,
          "en": "between the button and the first project in that list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 318,
          "end": 320.07,
          "en": "And therefore, on that unordered list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 320.07,
          "end": 322.05,
          "en": "I'll add some margin to the top",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 322.05,
          "end": 325.08299999999997,
          "en": "with the mt-8 class, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 326.763,
          "end": 330.663,
          "en": "So that this list is pushed down a little bit further.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 331.848,
          "end": 336.201,
          "en": "But with that, we now got our list of projects here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 336.201,
          "end": 339.9,
          "en": "Before we make sure that we can select these items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 339.9,
          "end": 341.88,
          "en": "and view some details here though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 341.88,
          "end": 344.31,
          "en": "I wanna first make sure that we make",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 344.31,
          "end": 346.62,
          "en": "this cancel button here work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 346.62,
          "end": 348.51,
          "en": "when we add a new project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 348.51,
          "end": 351.45799999999997,
          "en": "and that we show a modal with an error message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 351.45799999999997,
          "end": 354.78,
          "en": "if we click save without entering a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 354.78,
          "end": 356.49,
          "en": "into every input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 356.49,
          "end": 358.413,
          "en": "So that's what we'll work on next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
